om/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_1182381367083581_8403279582652785227_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oIsoxmstyOUQ7kNvwHkGXal&_nc_oc=AdkeqrDjRe2E2lfO-L5-AM0gshUZS83FxJCh_MtjU5mIXXFAA3bfOhwHaWVP2dNc30c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuMmiB1GT8r1Lm8zdcjokD9rh4blEc0XxTxiNUJPHaTdw&oe=69A050ED"}, {"file_name": "StoryMode.png", "id": "32811313745133632", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_32811313751800298_6861778986600558374_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-OH0Iq2m9H4Q7kNvwHIRVzL&_nc_oc=AdnjnKNo9yhGFD4UD3nNeDjNTJMDRYZecPAAQQsESUvEsT0y24OK-jmLgZtv8r-1aQ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft4Fr-NzPe01etp2VWKRvUGIKrppDMoLddYOIadDM1kEg&oe=69A05137"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GameThumbnail.png", "id": "864108156302774", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619685_864108159636107_8140054702670079169_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_fDt2kNJvKEQ7kNvwEiUONI&_nc_oc=AdlRhXh1hQ1JabK7G0ZDjt6NyUXGLbh-xcGGYIG8cgIZsqOgx9M6ldvdxXBWSAdjAkQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuCDqMkk197t_9QgpFgexN1Mf-DDhZJlY3uRH29B3cMBg&oe=69A0292C"}, "display_name": "Novalight", "keywords": ["Story", "Gamemodes", "Space", "Robots", "Adventure"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Novalight!\n\nNovalight is a free-to-play, hand-based movement multiplayer game that takes place thousands of years into the future where humans have gone extinct after a failed experiment caused the earth to explode.\n\n{2872839186238379}\n\n# Choose Your Own Path:\n\nJoin up to **20 players** in a public server or create a private one with friends!\n\nPlay through either the **Story Mode, Gamemodes** or perhaps just hangout & chat with friends in the lobby.\n\n{2244974466007548}\n\n# Customization:\n\nYou can customize your character with a wide variety of cosmetics!\n\nand may purchase them with **Nebulite** in the store!\nth